  <h3>Who We Are</h3>
  <p>Eben Nursery and Primary School is a premier day and boarding institution located in Migyera, Nakasongola. We are dedicated to providing a safe, nurturing, and academically rigorous environment for children from Nursery through Primary 7.</p>

  <h3>Our Mission</h3>
  <p>To provide holistic education that nurtures the mind, body, and spirit, empowering every child to "DECIDE YOUR DESTINY" through academic excellence and moral integrity.</p>

  <h3>Our Vision</h3>
  <p>To be the leading nursery and primary school in the region, recognized for producing well-rounded, confident, and responsible future leaders.</p>

  <h3>Why Choose Eben?</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Experienced and dedicated teaching staff.</li>
    <li>Modern facilities including spacious classrooms and a secure boarding section.</li>
    <li>A balanced curriculum combining academics, sports, and moral education.</li>
    <li>24/7 care and supervision for boarding students.</li>
  </ul>
